<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<title>Payments | HeartCode Admin</title>
</head>
<body data-page="payments">
<div class="admin-shell">
  <%- include('../partials/nav', { activePage: 'payments' }) %>
  <main class="admin-main">
    <section class="admin-page-intro">
      <div><p class="admin-eyebrow">Commerce &amp; currency</p><h1>Payments <span id="modeBadge" class="admin-badge admin-badge-brand">…</span></h1><p>Manage Paystack credentials, checkout currency behavior, and payment diagnostics.</p></div>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-split-grid admin-payments-grid">
      <div class="admin-card">
        <div class="admin-section-heading"><div><p class="admin-eyebrow">Gateway</p><h2>Paystack configuration</h2></div></div>
        <form id="paystackForm">
          <label class="admin-label" for="modeSelect">Mode</label><select class="admin-select" name="mode" id="modeSelect"><option value="test">Test</option><option value="live">Live</option></select>
          <div class="admin-subsection"><h3>Test keys</h3><label class="admin-label" for="publicKeyTest">Public key (test)</label><input class="admin-input" type="text" id="publicKeyTest"><label class="admin-label" for="secretKeyTest">Secret key (test)</label><input class="admin-input" type="password" id="secretKeyTest" placeholder="Leave blank to keep current key"><p id="secretTestMasked" class="admin-msg" style="display:none;"></p></div>
          <div class="admin-subsection"><h3>Live keys</h3><label class="admin-label" for="publicKeyLive">Public key (live)</label><input class="admin-input" type="text" id="publicKeyLive"><label class="admin-label" for="secretKeyLive">Secret key (live)</label><input class="admin-input" type="password" id="secretKeyLive" placeholder="Leave blank to keep current key"><p id="secretLiveMasked" class="admin-msg" style="display:none;"></p></div>
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="submit" class="admin-btn">Save payment settings</button><button type="button" id="clearTestBtn" class="admin-btn-outline">Clear test secret</button><button type="button" id="clearLiveBtn" class="admin-btn-outline">Clear live secret</button></div>
        </form><p id="statusMsg" class="admin-msg" style="display:none;"></p>
      </div>

      <div class="admin-card">
        <div class="admin-section-heading"><div><p class="admin-eyebrow">Currency</p><h2>Visitor pricing</h2></div></div>
        <div class="admin-setting-block"><div class="admin-setting-title"><h3>Currency display conversion</h3><span id="currencyConversionBadge" class="admin-badge admin-badge-error">…</span></div><p>Off by default: every visitor sees plain USD prices. Turn this on to show an estimated price in the visitor's local currency (based on their IP) before checkout. This never changes the amount actually charged.</p><button type="button" id="toggleCurrencyConversionBtn" class="admin-btn-outline">…</button><p id="currencyConversionStatus" class="admin-msg" style="display:none;"></p></div>
        <div class="admin-setting-block"><h3>Kenyan visitor payment currency</h3><p>Controls what currency Kenyan visitors are actually charged in. Leave this on USD until M-Pesa is set up and enabled on your Paystack account. Until then, Kenyan visitors are charged in USD by card, exactly like everyone else.</p><label class="admin-label" for="kenyanCurrencySelect">Charge Kenyan visitors in</label><select class="admin-select" id="kenyanCurrencySelect"><option value="USD">USD (default, until M-Pesa is set up)</option><option value="KES">KES (M-Pesa is set up on Paystack)</option></select><button type="button" id="saveKenyanCurrencyBtn" class="admin-btn mt-4">Save currency</button><p id="kenyanCurrencyStatus" class="admin-msg" style="display:none;"></p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-card mt-6">
      <div class="admin-section-heading"><div><p class="admin-eyebrow">Diagnostics</p><h2>Geolocation health check</h2></div></div>
      <p class="admin-card-description">Runs a live lookup against the local geolocation database (bypassing the 1-hour cache) and shows exactly what happened. Defaults to testing your own connection; to find out why a Kenyan visitor saw USD, paste a real visitor IP from your logs instead.</p>
      <div class="admin-form-grid-2 admin-diagnostic-row"><div><label class="admin-label" for="geoDiagnosticIp">IP address to test <span>(optional)</span></label><input class="admin-input" id="geoDiagnosticIp" type="text" placeholder="Leave blank to test your own connection"></div><div class="admin-form-align-end"><button type="button" id="runGeoDiagnosticBtn" class="admin-btn">Run diagnostic</button></div></div>
      <div id="geoDiagnosticResult" class="mt-4" style="display:none;"></div>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>
</body>
</html>
